WARNING: GPL-3.0 in the mlx-engine Python environment
-----------------------------------------------------
`make setup-deps` runs `uv sync` in mlx-engine/, which installs:

  phonemizer-fork      GPL-3.0     pulled in by misaki[en]
  espeakng-loader      GPL-3.0     bundles an eSpeak NG build

Both are hard requirements of `misaki[en]`, which Kokoro needs for English
phonemisation. They live in a virtualenv, are invoked by the local server, and
are not redistributed by this project — the `.app` bundle deliberately does not
embed the mlx-engine environment. If you bundle that virtualenv, or link this
code against it, GPL-3.0 applies to what you ship.


WARNING: BlackHole is GPL-3.0
-----------------------------
`scripts/setup-blackhole.sh` automates `brew install --cask blackhole-2ch`.
BlackHole is a separate GPL-3.0 audio driver, installed by Homebrew, not
distributed here. It is optional and only needed for loopback capture.


